CORE
ctg.json_symtab

^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
^malformed symbol table entry .a.: conditional target expression must have two operands$
--
^Invariant check failed
--
Rejects an array type whose size is a malformed conditional_target_group
expression without a type: named sub-trees of types that hold expressions are
checked whether or not these expressions have a type.
